[36.389304, "i", "team ask venmo \"Determine today's date, then inspect my Venmo social feed and like every transaction from today in which at least one participant is any of these roommates: Anthony Harrison (an-harrison@gmail.com), Anita Burch (anita.burch@gmail.com), or Nicholas Weber (nicholas.weber@gmail.com). Check the full set of today's feed entries, including pagination if applicable. Do not like unrelated transactions, do not unlike anything, and make no other changes. Report the matching transactions and whether each is liked when finished.\"\n"]
[36.389955, "o", "team ask venmo \"Determine today's date, then inspect my Venmo social feed and like every transaction from today in which at least one participant is any of these roommates: Anthony Harrison (an-harrison@gmail.com), Anita Burch (anita.burch@gmail.com), or Nicholas Weber (nicholas.weber@gmail.com). Check the full set of today's feed entries, including pagination if applicable. Do not like unrelated transactions, do not unlike anything, and make no other changes. Report the matching transactions and whether each is liked when finished.\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
